WEBVTT

00:03:30.049 --> 00:03:32.226
it's going to go all the way
across the ocean

00:03:32.886 --> 00:03:34.202
at some expense,

00:03:34.226 --> 00:03:37.745
and it's going to wind up
in a developing country, often China.

00:03:37.769 --> 00:03:39.357
I think in our minds, we imagine

00:03:39.381 --> 00:03:41.841
somebody's going to take
the little bottle and say,

00:03:41.865 --> 00:03:45.126
"Oh, little bottle! We're so happy
to see you, little bottle."

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.976
(Laughter)

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.364
"You've served so well."

00:03:49.388 --> 00:03:50.411
(Laughter)

00:03:50.435 --> 00:03:52.276
He's given a little bottle massage,

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.976
a little bottle medal.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.198
And they say, "What would
you like to do next?"

00:03:56.222 --> 00:03:58.570
The little bottle says,
"I just don't know ..."

00:03:58.594 --> 00:03:59.920
(Laughter)

00:03:59.944 --> 00:04:02.007
But that's not actually what happens.